{"input_path": "/mnt/c/Users/25840/Desktop/ocr-scan/ocr_json_app/out/peipu/pages/page04.png", "page_index": null, "page_count": null, "width": 1241, "height": 1754, "model_settings": {"use_doc_preprocessor": false, "use_layout_detection": true, "use_chart_recognition": false, "use_seal_recognition": false, "use_ocr_for_image_block": false, "format_block_content": false, "merge_layout_blocks": true, "markdown_ignore_labels": ["number", "footnote", "header", "header_image", "footer", "footer_image", "aside_text"], "return_layout_polygon_points": true}, "parsing_res_list": [{"block_label": "text", "block_content": "将不等式两边同时平方即可解得.", "block_bbox": [105, 160, 431, 189], "block_id": 0, "block_order": 1, "group_id": 0, "block_polygon_points": [[105.0, 160.0], [431.0, 160.0], [431.0, 189.0], [105.0, 189.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "本题考查绝对值不等式的求解，属于基础题.", "block_bbox": [106, 209, 541, 237], "block_id": 1, "block_order": 2, "group_id": 1, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 209.0], [541.0, 209.0], [541.0, 237.0], [106.0, 237.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "7. 已知等差数列$\\{a_n\\}$满足$\\begin{cases}a_1 + a_2 - a_3 = 3\\\\a_3 + a_4 - a_5 = 11\\end{cases}$，则$\\{a_n\\}$的前7项和$S_7 = $___。", "block_bbox": [106, 259, 814, 303], "block_id": 2, "block_order": 3, "group_id": 2, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 259.0], [814.0, 259.0], [814.0, 303.0], [106.0, 303.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "【答案】133", "block_bbox": [116, 325, 244, 352], "block_id": 3, "block_order": 4, "group_id": 3, "block_polygon_points": [[116.0, 325.0], [244.0, 325.0], [244.0, 352.0], [116.0, 352.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "【解析】解：等差数列$\\{a_n\\}$满足$\\begin{cases}a_1 + a_2 - a_3 = 3\\\\a_3 + a_4 - a_5 = 11\\end{cases}$", "block_bbox": [112, 370, 608, 420], "block_id": 4, "block_order": 5, "group_id": 4, "block_polygon_points": [[112.0, 370.0], [608.0, 370.0], [608.0, 420.0], [112.0, 420.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "即 $ \\left\\{\\begin{array}{l}a_{1}-d=3\\\\a_{1}+d=11\\end{array}\\right. $，解得 $ a_{1}=7 $，d=4；", "block_bbox": [112, 432, 472, 485], "block_id": 5, "block_order": 6, "group_id": 5, "block_polygon_points": [[112.0, 432.0], [472.0, 432.0], [472.0, 485.0], [112.0, 485.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "所以 $ \\{a_n\\} $的前7项和 $ S_7 = 7 \\times 7 + \\frac{1}{2} \\times 7 \\times 6 \\times 4 = 133 $.", "block_bbox": [106, 506, 619, 544], "block_id": 6, "block_order": 7, "group_id": 6, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 506.0], [619.0, 506.0], [619.0, 544.0], [106.0, 544.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "故答案为：133.", "block_bbox": [108, 567, 272, 595], "block_id": 7, "block_order": 8, "group_id": 7, "block_polygon_points": [[108.0, 567.0], [272.0, 567.0], [272.0, 595.0], [108.0, 595.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "根据等差数列的通项公式与前n项和公式，求解即可.", "block_bbox": [107, 616, 620, 643], "block_id": 8, "block_order": 9, "group_id": 8, "block_polygon_points": [[107.0, 616.0], [620.0, 616.0], [620.0, 643.0], [107.0, 643.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "本题考查了等差数列的通项公式与前n项和公式，是基础题.", "block_bbox": [107, 665, 685, 692], "block_id": 9, "block_order": 10, "group_id": 9, "block_polygon_points": [[107.0, 665.0], [685.0, 665.0], [685.0, 692.0], [107.0, 692.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "8. 已知随机变量 $ \\xi $服从正态分布 $ N(2, \\sigma^2) $. 若 $ P(\\xi \\leq 4) = 0.63 $，则 $ P(\\xi < 0) = $___．", "block_bbox": [106, 713, 875, 742], "block_id": 10, "block_order": 11, "group_id": 10, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 713.0], [875.0, 713.0], [875.0, 742.0], [106.0, 742.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "【答案】0.37", "block_bbox": [115, 763, 247, 790], "block_id": 11, "block_order": 12, "group_id": 11, "block_polygon_points": [[115.0, 763.0], [247.0, 763.0], [247.0, 790.0], [115.0, 790.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "【解析】解：已知随机变量 $ \\xi $服从正态分布 $ N(2,\\sigma^{2}) $。则该正态分布曲线对称轴为 $ \\xi=2 $，", "block_bbox": [112, 810, 928, 838], "block_id": 12, "block_order": 13, "group_id": 12, "block_polygon_points": [[112.0, 810.0], [928.0, 810.0], [928.0, 838.0], [112.0, 838.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "又 $ P(\\xi \\leq 4) = 0.63 $，则 $ P(0 < \\xi < 2) = P(2 < \\xi < 4) = P(\\xi \\leq 4) - P(\\xi \\leq 2) = 0.63 - 0.5 = 0.13 $，", "block_bbox": [112, 860, 1038, 888], "block_id": 13, "block_order": 14, "group_id": 13, "block_polygon_points": [[112.0, 860.0], [1038.0, 860.0], [1038.0, 888.0], [112.0, 888.0]]}, {"block_label": "inline_formula", "block_content": " $$ P(\\xi<0)=P(\\xi\\leq2)-P(0<\\xi<2)=0.5-0.13=0.37. $$ ", "block_bbox": [134, 909, 682, 935], "block_id": 14, "block_order": 15, "group_id": 14, "block_polygon_points": [[134.0, 909.0], [682.0, 909.0], [682.0, 935.0], [134.0, 935.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "故答案为：0.37.", "block_bbox": [107, 958, 275, 985], "block_id": 15, "block_order": 16, "group_id": 15, "block_polygon_points": [[107.0, 958.0], [275.0, 958.0], [275.0, 985.0], [107.0, 985.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "根据正态分布相关性质可解.", "block_bbox": [107, 1006, 387, 1033], "block_id": 16, "block_order": 17, "group_id": 16, "block_polygon_points": [[107.0, 1006.0], [387.0, 1006.0], [387.0, 1033.0], [107.0, 1033.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "本题考查正态分布相关性质，属于中档题.", "block_bbox": [107, 1055, 519, 1082], "block_id": 17, "block_order": 18, "group_id": 17, "block_polygon_points": [[107.0, 1055.0], [519.0, 1055.0], [519.0, 1082.0], [107.0, 1082.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "9. 已知  $ m \\in R $，若幂函数  $ y = (m^2 - \\frac{5}{2}m + 2)x^m $ 是偶函数，则  $ m =  $___．", "block_bbox": [105, 1109, 791, 1144], "block_id": 18, "block_order": 19, "group_id": 18, "block_polygon_points": [[105.0, 1109.0], [791.0, 1109.0], [791.0, 1144.0], [105.0, 1144.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "【答案】2", "block_bbox": [115, 1169, 218, 1196], "block_id": 19, "block_order": 20, "group_id": 19, "block_polygon_points": [[115.0, 1169.0], [218.0, 1169.0], [218.0, 1196.0], [115.0, 1196.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "【解析】解：根据题意，函数 $ y=(m^2-\\frac{5}{2}m+2)x^m $是幂函数，则有 $ m^2-\\frac{5m}{2}+2=1 $，解可得 $ m=2 $或 $ m=\\frac{1}{2} $，当 $ m=\\frac{1}{2} $时，该函数为 $ y=x^{\\frac{1}{2}}=\\sqrt{x} $，不是偶函数，不符合题意；", "block_bbox": [111, 1218, 1116, 1329], "block_id": 20, "block_order": 21, "group_id": 20, "block_polygon_points": [[111.0, 1218.0], [1116.0, 1218.0], [1116.0, 1329.0], [111.0, 1329.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "当m=2时，该函数为 $ y=x^{2} $，是偶函数，符合题意；", "block_bbox": [110, 1347, 622, 1375], "block_id": 21, "block_order": 22, "group_id": 21, "block_polygon_points": [[110.0, 1347.0], [622.0, 1347.0], [622.0, 1375.0], [110.0, 1375.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "故m=2.", "block_bbox": [110, 1396, 205, 1422], "block_id": 22, "block_order": 23, "group_id": 22, "block_polygon_points": [[110.0, 1396.0], [205.0, 1396.0], [205.0, 1422.0], [110.0, 1422.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "故答案为：2.", "block_bbox": [108, 1445, 247, 1472], "block_id": 23, "block_order": 24, "group_id": 23, "block_polygon_points": [[108.0, 1445.0], [247.0, 1445.0], [247.0, 1472.0], [108.0, 1472.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "根据题意，由幂函数的定义求出m的值，验证函数的奇偶性可得答案.", "block_bbox": [106, 1493, 777, 1522], "block_id": 24, "block_order": 25, "group_id": 24, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 1493.0], [777.0, 1493.0], [777.0, 1522.0], [106.0, 1522.0]]}, {"block_label": "text", "block_content": "本题考查函数奇偶性的性质和应用，涉及幂函数的定义，属于基础题.", "block_bbox": [106, 1542, 782, 1571], "block_id": 25, "block_order": 26, "group_id": 25, "block_polygon_points": [[106.0, 1542.0], [782.0, 1542.0], [782.0, 1571.0], [106.0, 1571.0]]}, {"block_label": "number", "block_content": "第4页，共19页", "block_bbox": [546, 1656, 695, 1680], "block_id": 26, "block_order": null, "group_id": 26, "block_polygon_points": [[546.0, 1656.0], [695.0, 1656.0], [695.0, 1680.0], [546.0, 1680.0]]}], "layout_det_res": {"input_path": null, "page_